//   `parser.IsCompletePrefix(currentConstrainedOut)` already holds; it returns
//   `insideConstrainedOut = false`, so the implication becomes vacuous.
// - Constrained-symbol branch: `ConstrainedSymbol` returns a parser-valid
//   constrained prefix `symbolOut`; assigning `currentConstrainedOut := symbolOut`
//   therefore preserves validity. If EOS is reported, we break immediately.
